<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Products & barcodes · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>.product-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:14px}.product-row small{display:block;margin-top:5px}#products>details{margin:12px 0}#products summary{padding:14px;font-weight:700;background:#eadcf5;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer}#editor{max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;width:min(700px,96vw)}#product-photo{display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:240px;object-fit:contain;margin:12px auto}#product-photo[hidden],#photo-file[hidden]{display:none}#title{outline:none}input[readonly]{background:#eee9f1;color:#61566d}#editor .actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:#fff4e8;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #ddd0e9}#photo-status,#editor-status{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.product-photo-section{padding-bottom:18px;margin-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd0e9}</style></head><body><main><h1>Products & barcodes</h1><p>Scan a product or find it by name, SKU or UPC. Each SKU identifies its own product.</p><div class="toolbar"><input id="search" placeholder="Scan or search products" aria-label="Search products"><button id="refresh">Refresh list</button><button id="keyboard">Hide keyboard</button></div><p id="message" role="status"></p><div id="products"></div><dialog id="editor"><form id="details"><h2 id="title" tabindex="-1" autofocus></h2><section class="product-photo-section"><h3>Product identification photo</h3><img id="product-photo" hidden><p id="photo-status" role="status"></p><input id="photo-file" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><button type="button" id="choose-photo">Add / replace photo</button></section><label>Product name<input name="name" required></label><label>SKU · managed in QuickBooks<input name="sku" readonly aria-readonly="true"></label><p>Change the SKU directly in QuickBooks, then refresh this list.</p><label>Weight / size<input name="weight"></label><label>Description<textarea name="description"></textarea></label><button class="primary">Save product information</button><h3>Barcode aliases</h3><div id="barcodes"></div><label>New barcode<input id="code" autocomplete="off"></label><button type="button" id="add">Add barcode</button><p id="editor-status" role="status"></p><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="close">Close</button><button type="button" id="hide">Hide keyboard</button></div></form></dialog></main><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/warehouse-products.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/product-request-review.js"></script></body></html>
